Origin: termux-packages 91af886 packages/apt/0004-no-hardcoded-paths.patch
Change: adapted: Termux's hunks for paths apt 3 still has; apt-key and the dmesg/df report hunks are gone (apt-key left apt in 3.1; the report runs the host's tools either way). Replaces apt's hardcoded paths with @TERMUX_PREFIX@, which build-apt.sh maps to $PREFIX or back to the host. Native need.
License: GPL-2.0-or-later

